-   (u8*)ptr = (u8*)(psxM + psxRu32(base));
-     becomes
-   *(u8*)&ptr = (u8*)(psxM + psxRu32(base));
-
-  gcc is perfectly fine with this. For now.
-  There are also some minor Makefile updates, removing gcc-3.4 specifics.
